Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:06.94,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You look like a different person, Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:10.17,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,When I haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, a lot has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:16.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And experience affects everyone differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.54,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:23.76,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I think I might be too timid to be a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:27.71,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I've tried to get over it, \Nbut it never works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:35.40,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I should really be participating in A and \NB-Rank raids... or at least C-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:39.09,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,But I chose D and E-Rank ones on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:46.36,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,That's how I met you, and found myself \Nhealing you time and time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:52.07,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,At first, it was a little annoying \Nhow often you got injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:56.25,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,But you always managed to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:01:02.17,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the way that your eyes \Nalways seemed to radiate vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:06.36,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,We promised to go out to eat somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:09.67,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,You can have this back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:11.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:15.10,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'm going to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:18.73,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I'm moving back in with my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:22.65,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,If you ever find yourself in the area, \Nlet me know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:24.15,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I can show you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:29.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll invite you out again, if that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.94,0:01:31.14,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:50.42,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,I don't believe an E-Rank like yourself \Ncould defeat a B-Rank like Kang Taeshik.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:55.67,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,You've already been examined \Nfor a potential reawakening, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.21,0:01:58.97,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,But I feel I should warn you anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.43,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,If you want to live a long life, \Nbe careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.94,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:07.72,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,After the incident where Hwang Dongsuk's \Nstrike team was wiped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:10.86,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,with you and the D-Rank hunter \Nas the only survivors...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:17.24,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Hwang Dongsuk's younger brother, \NHwang Dongsoo, may be targeting you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.73,0:02:21.87,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hwang Dongsoo, the S-Rank hunter, is after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.87,0:02:25.49,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,Correct. It doesn't matter\Nwhat actually happened in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:31.53,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,All he cares about is that Hwang Dongsuk \Ndied, while you managed to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:37.00,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,The law is powerless to deal with S-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:41.34,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,They have the potential to bring forth \Neither miracle or calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:48.67,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,In other words, one of the monsters that \Neven monsters fear is out for your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:54.99,Flashback,Woo Jinchul,0,0,0,,If possible, I'd recommend taking \Nyour family and leaving the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:03:01.24,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's one more reason I need to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:03.81,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Because if I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I won't be able to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:44.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Uh, Jinho? What am I looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:49.17,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,What do you mean? It's obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:50.69,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,This is our strike team!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:55.71,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I prioritized people who are qualified to be \Nhunters but have reasons they can't work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.71,0:04:59.24,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,and people who are having trouble getting by \Nwhen making my selections.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You've got injured people... and drunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.73,0:05:03.89,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That works better for us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:07.30,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,We need a minimum of eight people \Nto raid C-Rank gates, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:11.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Hey, you've got a kid here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:17.11,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,As long as they've awakened, \Nthere's no legal issue with recruiting minors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.12,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:20.85,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,That's kind of rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:23.31,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,I am a qualified hunter, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But you're in high school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:27.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Do you have any raiding experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:29.78,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What rank? E?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:34.27,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,So what if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:35.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:38.03,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You'll be waiting out here anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.52,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Jinho and I will be the only ones \Ngoing into the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:46.40,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,Hey... Is it seriously going \Nto be just the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:49.62,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,And does this job really pay three million \Njust for waiting outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:52.91,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right. Three million per raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:55.46,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Pretty sweet deal, considering \Nyou don't have to fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:59.05,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,The only stipulation \Nis that you can't talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:02.53,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,If you publicize our deal, \Nthe contract specifies
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:05.26,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,you'll have to pay back ten times that amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.10,0:06:09.65,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Stealth rune stone that \NI got by beating Kang Taeshik...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:12.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Might as well use it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:26.32,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay. Looks like it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.18,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What are you wearing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.79,0:06:36.59,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,A full set of buff-boosting armor \Nmade by an Italian manufacturer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:40.25,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,If we're gonna hit the dungeon together, boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:42.82,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I need to be at least this ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:50.55,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to be mean here, \Nbut take that stuff off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.00,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:59.52,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss, can you help me get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.82,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,All right. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.51,0:07:06.32,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,This is kind of nerve-racking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You've, uh, still got something on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:11.30,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,At least let me keep the helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:15.58,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Fine, fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.35,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:20.43,Default,Hunter D,0,0,0,,They're seriously going in alone. \NIs this gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.43,0:07:24.84,Default,Hunter A,0,0,0,,We did warn them. And the contract's been \Npaid out already, so what's it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:30.19,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,A D and an E-Rank taking on \Na C-Rank raid by themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:34.85,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,Those two greenhorns don't have \Na damn clue what they're getting into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.27,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Is Song-yi skipping today?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:48.16,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,How long's it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:53.06,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,About an hour. Even a normal strike team \Nwould take at least two hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:54.20,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,so we've got a while—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:59.42,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,So they ran away. They're lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.75,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,N-No! They didn't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:04.98,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,The gate's starting to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:08.68,Default,Hunter A,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me? They beat the boss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.62,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Where's the next gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.64,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,About an hour from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.77,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Got it. Let's hurry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:19.24,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,We're moving, everyone! \NThe goal is to hit three locations today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:24.36,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,That means you could potentially earn nine \Nmillion in one day. Are you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.95,0:08:26.51,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,These guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:28.73,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,Who the hell are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:37.09,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss! I'm done mining!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.09,0:08:38.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.29,0:08:40.21,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I better wrap up here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:50.65,Default,Sung Jinah,0,0,0,,Huh? More work today?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:53.05,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yep. Don't forget to lock up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.08,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,He was hiding a skill like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:27.55,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss has gotten stronger again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This Stealth skill...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:33.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It wasn't fun to earn, but it's useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:36.66,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Fighting while unseen is really effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.44,0:09:42.80,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My Dash skill leveled up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:52.74,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And my new skills, Advanced Dagger Wielding \Nand Fatal Strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They seem pretty useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.67,0:10:00.43,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Great work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:04.42,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Once I'm finished grabbing this stuff, \Nwe'll be done, so you can take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got some handy new skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:14.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I don't have enough mana \Nto use them for very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:17.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll need to work on my \Nintellect ability going forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.93,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Things are moving smoothly, \Nso do I head to the Demon Castle next?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.90,0:10:30.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No. Right now, I'd say I'm somewhere \Nbetween B and A-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:33.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Would I really be able \Nto take that dungeon on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:40.79,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"The Player has reached the required level"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:45.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A job-change quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.66,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Take a look at this, Manager Ahn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.63,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,What is it, Kichul?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:55.76,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Well, it's about the C-Rank gates...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.59,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,One hundred and fifty million?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:11:03.08,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Someone's spending 150 million \Non the rights to C-Rank gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.58,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Right. There's a strike team \Nthat's been spending
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:09.86,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,nearly double the market rate \Non C-Rank gates...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:15.47,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,And the leader is... Yoo Jinho? \NNever heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:18.77,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,He's the younger son of Yoojin \NConstruction's president.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.77,0:11:20.49,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Yoojin Construction?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:22.70,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This could put them in the red over time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:26.25,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Seems excessive for a rich kid playing hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:30.46,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Sung Jinwoo... E-Rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.46,0:11:33.87,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Their whole lineup \Nseems thrown together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.87,0:11:35.69,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,I have no idea what the plan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:40.94,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hang on. I remember seeing \Nthis "Sung Jinwoo" name
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.94,0:11:44.03,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,connected to the double dungeon incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.03,0:11:46.77,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,There's something here. I can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:52.82,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.82,0:11:54.72,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,Nah, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.90,Default,Hunter D,0,0,0,,You're ahead of schedule, even!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:12:00.42,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Collecting the mana crystals \Ntook longer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.71,0:12:02.12,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:05.55,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,You've gotta be exhausted. \NYou want me to drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.83,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,I've had nothing to do all day, so I'm \Nhonestly kinda bored. Would that be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.55,DefaultTop,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:12.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:16.26,DefaultTop,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,But the contract says you don't need \Nto worry about doing anything, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:13.80,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.72,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,You think this Sung Jinwoo \Nhunter has reawakened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:21.53,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:23.01,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Based on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:28.27,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung has been through three \Nmajor disasters and survived every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.02,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,First, the double dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:35.03,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Second, the wiping out of \NHwang Dongsuk's strike team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:39.45,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,And third, Kang Taeshik's murder spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:45.07,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Every time, there was a large body count, \Nbut every time, he was among the survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:48.14,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,The only explanation is that he reawakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.62,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,I guess you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:55.05,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,So where are you headed, Manager Ahn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:57.51,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:01.50,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'm off to scout a promising rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:09.25,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,What is this, a picnic?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.74,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.19,0:13:15.40,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,This area's off-limits, y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:17.34,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Ah, you'll have to forgive us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:21.11,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,We saw a bunch of hunters and got curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:24.87,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,That's a gate, right? \NIs it safe for you to be so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:28.83,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Don't treat me like a child. I'm a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:33.04,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Then are you part of this strike team?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:35.85,Default,Han Song-yi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.07,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:44.20,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung! He must've left his group \Nbehind to tackle the dungeon himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:48.67,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,If my gut's right about this, he could be \Na huge find! Even bigger than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:52.15,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I see. Well, sorry for disturbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:54.08,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,You be careful, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.19,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Wait, are we leaving already, Manager?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:02.11,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,The captain's back! \NEverybody get ready to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:07.05,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What's the schedule looking like for tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I remembered I have something \Nto do. Can I get the day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.04,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,For tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:16.65,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I had reserved some gates... \NYou want me to cancel them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:20.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's not go that far. \NIt seems like a waste of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.56,0:14:22.97,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,I can hold onto them for another two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:27.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's delay them for now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:28.83,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:32.89,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait, everyone! \NOff to the next one we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.78,Default,Choi Jong-in,0,0,0,,The same dream... again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.50,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.07,Default,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Good work today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:35.25,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I apologize if this is sudden. Hunter Sung...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.53,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.53,0:15:40.71,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'm Ahn Sangmin, manager of the White \NTiger Guild's Second Administration Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:43.62,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Could I trouble you \Nfor a moment of your time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:47.88,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:53.04,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,but the White Tiger Guild \Nis one of the country's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:56.66,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,However, we're always on the lookout \Nfor promising new talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:16:00.08,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,And to get directly to the point,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:06.07,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,if you'll join us, I'm willing to pay you \Ndouble what Yoojin Construction is offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:10.66,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,If you have any additional conditions, \NI'd be happy to arrange those, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:12.19,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,How about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.19,0:16:16.20,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This is too good an offer for someone \Nwho was E-Rank just a while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:18.82,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He's bound to say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.29,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How much is the White \NTiger Guild's HQ valued at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:24.71,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:29.38,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I'd say somewhere \Naround fifty billion...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:32.47,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And that's what you're offering me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.68,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I... I don't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:41.73,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Th-Thirty billion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.69,Default,BG Woman,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:49.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's the market value of the building \Nthat Yoojin Construction has offered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:55.54,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You offered to double that, so I was thinking \Na building worth fifty billion would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:58.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've got the documentation here, \Nif you don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.65,0:17:01.88,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I, er, I must admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:05.16,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,an offer like that isn't something \NI'd be qualified to make on my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:07.09,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'd need to talk to my superiors—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.09,0:17:09.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think we're done here, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:13.48,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I was too desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:17.40,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I should've dug into his deal \Nwith Yoojin Construction first!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:22.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I am curious, though. \NWho did you hear about me from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:26.13,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You haven't been snooping around, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.00,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,H-Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:39.05,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,That... That was the Stealth skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.05,0:17:41.92,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,A reawakened with Stealth?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:46.18,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,That'd explain the size of the offer \NYoojin Construction made!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:50.04,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I-I do apologize for looking you up \Nwithout any word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.76,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,But I meant no harm—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:59.54,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,The tight dungeon market has led \Nto a delay in rookie training,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:02.48,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,without which they can't be sent \Non raids as per Guild policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:08.05,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I was investigating who was \Nbuying up so many gates
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:10.99,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,when I came across your name, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:14.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Who else knows about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:20.11,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Just me and one of my subordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:23.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd rather keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:28.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If people start hearing about me, Mr. Ahn, \Nyou two will be the first people I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:33.59,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'm obligated to make a formal report \Nto the head of my guild...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:38.70,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,but I don't want to die. I'll make sure \Nmy subordinate keeps his mouth shut, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:40.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.45,0:18:45.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess monopolizing the C-Rank gates \Nhas been causing some trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:49.27,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we'll need to continue \Ndoing so for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:54.20,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,That is a shame. It puts a real \Nbottleneck on our developing hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How about a deal, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:58.99,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,A d-deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.39,0:19:03.45,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm willing to sell you the rights \Nto three of our C-Rank gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.45,0:19:05.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If you pass on this, you may \Nas well consider your guild
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,locked out of C-Ranks \Nfor the foreseeable future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:10.45,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He giving me the hard sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:11.55,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.55,0:19:14.18,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Understood. For how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.74,0:19:16.50,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Three hundred million apiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.50,0:19:18.26,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Three... Three hundred million?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.85,0:19:26.23,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,The mana crystals and essence stones \Nare only worth 200 million on a good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.57,0:19:28.86,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Could you at least lower the price to two—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:29.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:33.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Consider it a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.16,0:19:38.38,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Th-Then we'll be taking three off your hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:42.12,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right. Three C-Rank gates, \Nfor a total of 600 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.50,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,A-All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:49.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Transfer the money here by the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One other thing. You can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.25,0:19:54.66,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Close your eyes and open your mouth, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:58.18,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's okay. I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.48,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,No way! The cut is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.73,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:20.00,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,If you're willing to show me all this, \Ncan I take it as a sign that you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:24.10,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,As long as you keep your mouth shut, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.83,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,M-Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.61,0:20:31.81,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,How'd it go? The scouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.81,0:20:34.05,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Well, Kichul...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:38.36,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I think he might be a bigger deal \Nthan I had even imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:47.98,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,Boss, I confirmed the transfer. \NThe six hundred mill is really there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:52.65,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,We were about to cancel these gates... \NHow'd you sell them at such a crazy price?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:54.83,DefaultItalics,Yoo Jinho,0,0,0,,And to whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.82,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's call it a trade secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:02.62,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,What do you mean there are extra \NC-Rank gates in our jurisdiction?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:03.65,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.65,0:21:06.87,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,The three we bought were the only ones \Nthat Yoojin Construction had purchased!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:10.07,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,And the rest are all selling \Nfor 70 million or less!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.58,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,He tricked you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.58,0:21:13.66,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:17.66,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Not only did I fail at scouting him, \Nbut he scammed me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:19.30,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,What a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.76,DefaultItalics,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I guess if you're strong enough, \Nyou become bold enough to do anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:26.72,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,A message? But from who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:28.95,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is Sung Jinwoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.95,0:21:32.46,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,With this, we're even. I'll forget \Nthe fact that you spied on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.40,0:21:37.36,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Okay. So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.36,0:21:39.86,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,That's one in his favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:42.20,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,This guy sure isn't to be messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.52,Default,Hyun Kichul,0,0,0,,Was that from Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:45.59,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:51.78,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,He might have raked me over the coals, \Nbut I've got Hunter Sung's contact info.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.63,0:21:55.56,Default,Ahn Sangmin,0,0,0,,I'll be satisfied with that for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:22:01.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A job-change quest, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:03.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Should be interesting.
